<title>FRANCE: Renault 1996 turnover flat.</title>
<headline>Renault 1996 turnover flat.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Revenues				     184,078    vs 184,065</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>	Automobile Division		    145,962    vs 142,614</p>
<p>	Commercial Vehicles Division	  30,007    vs  32,926</p>
<p>	Finance Division			   8,109    vs   8,525</p>
<p>NOTE - Renault said that since January 1, 1996, the automobile division includes on an accounting basis the former Industrial Companies Division which had contributed 6,170 million francs to 1995 consolidated revenues.</p>
<p>&quot;The 1995 figures correspond to data published in 1995, after adding together the contributions of the automobile division and the Industrial Companies Division,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Revenues of the commercial vehicles division for 1996 take into account Karosa's inclusion in the group's scope of consolidation.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
